; Spec 05-047: shared by every domain the Corefile lists with it -- names are relative, so each
; zone gets its own MX. Just enough for email-service to approve the domain by MX.
$TTL 60
@     IN SOA  ns admin 1 3600 600 86400 60
@     IN NS   ns
ns    IN A    192.0.2.1
@     IN MX   10 mail
mail  IN A    192.0.2.3
